### career

## The car lot and the career car select: why a purchase, a sale or a release is refused.

career-car-not-in-lot = That car is not in the car lot.
career-car-not-for-sale = This car is not for sale.
career-car-not-available = This car is not available yet.
career-car-already-owned = You already own this car.
career-car-no-sale-here = You cannot sell a car here.
career-car-not-in-safehouse = That car is not in your safe house.

## The career list (load and delete) and the manual save.

# The save question when the language table has none, or there is no alias to name.
career-save-question = Save your career progress?
career-delete-question = Delete the career named { $alias }? It cannot be undone.
career-no-saves = There are no careers saved yet.

## The marker selection list (Remastered look).

# A revealed card whose marker has no name in the language table.
career-marker = Marker
# A card not revealed yet, numbered from 1.
career-marker-card = Marker { $n }

## The rep sheets' vertical list (Remastered look).

# A won race event: the race kind, then the mark.
career-sheet-won = { $kind }  (won)
career-sheet-speed-trap = Speed Trap
career-sheet-complete = Complete
career-sheet-locked = Locked

## The race kinds of the quick race board: a track's title, and its kind when the language table has no name for it.

career-race-kind-sprint = Sprint
career-race-kind-circuit = Circuit
career-race-kind-drag = Drag
career-race-kind-knockout = Circuit - K.O.
career-race-kind-tollbooth = Tollbooth
career-race-kind-speedtrap = Speedtrap
career-race-kind-race = Race
